WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.370
Izayoi
Dorm

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.410
Rescue Team: Standby!

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.660
Dr. Hotaru, please go to the hangar.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.040
I can't get the cockpit open!
Dr. Hotaru, please go to the hangar.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.160
We're going to cut the logic array
and physically force it open. Get ready!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.540
Say, we did our best out there, didn't we?

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.200
Nebula...

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.910
It's okay. Let's sleep for now... together.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.000
Imber...

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.250
You are...

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.160
Nubilum has returned. It is moored in Silo No. 6.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:02.750
Frame Inspection Team, commence work.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.250
The ground crew responsible for Nubilum
are to take their assigned positions.
Frame Inspection Team, commence work.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.120
The ground crew responsible for Nubilum
are to take their assigned positions.
Damage Maintenance Team B,

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:05.830
Damage Maintenance Team B,

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:06.040
activate the echo sensor.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.250
We will patch up the areas
that have reached Level 4 fatigue.
activate the echo sensor.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.790
We will patch up the areas
that have reached Level 4 fatigue.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:09.200
Place top priority on conserving supplies.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.660
Repair Crew, stay on standby.
Place top priority on conserving supplies.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:11.330
Chihaya!

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:11.790
Chihaya!
Prepare for the next sortie.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:12.790
Prepare for the next sortie.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.620
There really is no helping that boy.

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:21.040
Chihaya, ummm...
You should go to the infirmary.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.040
I'm just fine.

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:31.330
I am being filled...

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:32.870
...with whiteness.

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:56.000
Kono sora no shita itsu made mo

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.950
Sagashi tsuzuketa yume

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:02.200
Hitorikiri...

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:07.830
Doko e minna tabidatsu no?

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:13.250
Kioku no hibi ga toozakaru

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:18.410
Ano koro no egao wa

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:25.040
Mune no naka ima wo sasaeteta

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:34.870
Mugon no yokogao de anata mo watashi mo kitto

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.450
Kizu yue no persona wakatte ita yo

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:41.540
Kizu yue no persona wakatte ita yo

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:46.000
Shiawase no tame ni ai no tame dakara to

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.500
Zankoku na tatakai wo kuri kaeshite

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.790
Sore de mo namida ga tomaranai

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:58.160
Negau kokoro wa issho

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:04.950
Sorezore no mirai ga yobunda

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.750
I ordered the government to declare this

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.330
a state of emergency and
hold a news conference.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:17.870
108 Years of Reconstruction

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:18.250
To think that they were able
to successfully reclaim Imber.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.410
That was a pleasing miscalculation.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.540
It is now set in stone
that we have the upper hand.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:29.540
At present, Imber and Nebula
are under the iDOL Team's control.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.160
Should I hold them in check?

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:35.700
We will wait and see how our operation
progresses first. How is it coming?

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.200
Just a moment ago we
successfully infiltrated Turiavita

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.830
and pinpointed the location
to their headquarters.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.200
We are currently carrying out the operation
to assassinate Teru Lo-Wu.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.790
So we've finally caught her?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.250
The chick's preparations are
underway, are they not?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:55.750
They are. But I believe I am going
to need a little more time.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:59.120
Very well. Don't mess this up.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:00.580
Roger that.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.540
Tell the governments of the world
that we have pinpointed

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:11.910
Turiavita's headquarters at 420km
west of the Crozet Islands.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:21.950
An artificial storm...

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:26.200
The only way to render them defenseless
is to destroy their power reactor.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:30.950
What?!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.620
What's the meaning of this?

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.330
Makoto?

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.540
Hiems has just returned.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:51.200
Teams A and B, begin maintenance.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.330
Hey, did anyone open
Emergency Exit B53?

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.200
Tell them to be done by 16:00.
Hey, did anyone open
Emergency Exit B53?

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:54.790
No.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:55.700
Yes, sir!
No.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:59.580
That's strange. Someone has entered
the lock-release code.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:00.370
What is it?

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.620
Someone has unlocked an emergency exit.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:05.910
It can't be...

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.830
Did they trace her?

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.200
Bitter!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:15.620
So are you saying that the
massive damage Tokyo has taken

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.620
Mondenkind
Chichibu Branch Office

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:17.200
along with the current declaration
that we are in a state of emergency

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.580
has to do with the organization called Turiavita?

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:22.540
Turiavita... What's that?

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:23.500
Beats me.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.250
We are currently investigating the details,

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:31.620
but both the United Nations and Mondenkind
agree that this is due to their terrorist activity.

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:33.750
That is what the government is claiming.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:36.080
With Mondenkind in the fore,

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:40.620
the United Nations Strategic Alliance Fleet, the
UNNFA, is currently taking action to suppress them.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.870
They are of the opinion that Japan and its
neighboring countries are in no immediate threat.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.870
I shall now repeat the report.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:49.950
What's going on here?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.750
Won't they cause a panic by announcing

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:56.700
that the terrorist group
Turiavita possesses iDOLs?

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.410
That's why we've kept them a secret...

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:01.700
Why did this have to happen now?

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.330
Miss Sorewa!

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:04.910
Sir?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.450
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:15.330
"During my past few years here, you have
treated me as a comrade and as a 'person,'

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.290
BLACK
LACQUER

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.410
"rather than as a mere test subject."

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:17.450
TO
JOSEPH
SHINGETSU

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:22.750
"As such, this is my last request
as a 'person'."

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:26.290
"Please take action before this is all over."

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:32.160
"I believe that once I have
assassinated Teru Lo-Wu,

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.370
"the Cat's Grand Lodge
will requisition the iDOLs

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:38.040
"and try to bury everything in darkness,
including the iDOLs."

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.540
"Once that happens, it will be
too late to take action."

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:47.080
"You know that there is a future where
people and iDOLs can be together."

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.250
"That is why..."

00:06:55.540 --> 00:07:00.290
I want you to infiltrate the system in
Geneva's headquarters. Can you do that?

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:04.000
Umm, but if I did...

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:08.620
It is imperative that we know all of the facts.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.250
Roger!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:16.450
If we can offer her even a little support...
Even just a little...

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.790
Use Attack 1520 on the target.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:24.080
Upon verifying the point, Lumberjack
is to return to base immediately.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.290
Roger!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:39.750
Bitch!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:51.700
Who's there?

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.660
Hey, this is all your fault.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.200
If I don't kill you, Mama will throw me away.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.910
I'll get called a failed bastard... by Mama!

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:12.620
It appears to be a UNNFA patrol copter.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.200
Have they homed in on our location?

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.750
Impossible! Our barrier
is perfectly functional.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:22.700
Don't panic. Even if they know our location,
it won't be easy for them to attack us.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.540
Prepare Epimetheus-

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:26.830
What is it?

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:29.750
The power supply's system
has been unlocked!

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:30.830
What?

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.750
I cannot identify the ID used to unlock it!

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:36.500
Just like cream, white cream...

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:40.410
All output from the Magna Eye
is flowing into one system.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.700
What system?

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.660
It is listed as "Schmelzofen".

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:47.450
Due to a drop in voltage, I cannot
secure enough power for ignition.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.750
We cannot deploy the Epimetheus units!

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.410
Reset the flow of power!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.250
I cannot access that system! It's locked.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.410
What?!

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:58.750
The weather system is down!
The artificial storm zone is dissipating!

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:02.040
Direct the Magna Eye's power
output to maintaining the weather!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.700
The system is not responding!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:11.000
She truly is worthless.
Damn your daughter!

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.700
Yukiho, could you lend me a hand?

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:17.540
Certainly!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.290
Why aren't you firing?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.000
Because that isn't necessary.

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:27.910
Now you've really ticked me off!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.120
I can kill you so stinking easily!

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:35.660
You shouldn't underestimate an adult.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.000
Note: "Schmelzofen" is German for "Furnace"

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:44.000
Schmelzofen...? What is that?

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:49.000
It's a system that physically melds
a human with an iDOL.

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:54.790
Imber and I are going to become one.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:59.250
I am going to melt into
something pure white.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.580
I will feel wonderful and taste very sweet.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.120
You mean you're...?

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.450
I'll be a fluffy marshmallow.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:08.790
Or simmering milk cream.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.870
Chihaya, are you going to pass away?
Or simmering milk cream.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.830
Chihaya, are you going to pass away?

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.660
Please...

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.200
This is my dream.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:02.370
Long time no see, Chihaya.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:05.700
Ma'am?

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:22.330
Got it!

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:25.500
I've connected with Headquarters'
real-time circuit!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.660
I'll put the main screen on the monitor.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.830
Is that Turiavita's headquarters?

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:33.620
This just came in!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:37.200
Various navies are rendezvousing
with the Alliance's fleet!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.580
It looks like they are assisting
in the assault.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.910
But they should be well aware that

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:44.950
conventional forces
cannot destroy an iDOL.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:47.080
What is the situation?

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:49.370
They finally finished disassembling Nebula.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:52.040
They just finished installing
Imber's new cockpit.

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:01.450
Isn't this...?

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:12.250
Damn it!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:16.580
We were hit by a bunker buster! The iDOL
silo's metal walls have been destroyed!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:19.620
We lost the Epimetheus units
that were on standby!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:22.250
This isn't funny! I won't let this stop me...!

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:24.870
Do whatever it takes to
regain control of the system!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.410
You were still working on this?

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.700
Why not? Just let me do as I please.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:54.200
Now I can melt into something pure white
and become one with him.

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:58.950
Chihaya, you...

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.750
I will set you free now.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.000
Don't get in my way!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.500
Let's put this to an end.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:15.620
No matter where we run,
there is no escape from this darkness.

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:20.290
Please get away from there!

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:23.500
I'm begging you! Please leave, Ma'am!

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.450
Please get away from Chihaya!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.290
Yukiho, you...

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:34.700
Please let Chihaya's
dream come true! Please!

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:40.080
I can't. This is all meaningless.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.370
Her dream is already over.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:47.080
Please don't say that! Don't say it's over!

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:51.250
I want to make Chihaya's dream come true!

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:53.910
That's why!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.250
That's why...

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.410
That's why I really will shoot you next time.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.040
I have to go...

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.500
I'm going to dissolve...

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:29.910
The marshmallow is going to melt.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:35.040
That's enough. Let her do as she wishes.

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.080
Sis...

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.000
The enemy is still silent.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:47.750
The unified marines have commenced
preparations to disembark.

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.950
It's just about time we wrapped this up.
How is the chick?

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.000
Phase 3 is in progress.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:57.450
Tell the landing forces that we will
not adjust the time for the mission.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:58.750
Yes, sir!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.580
Be careful.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:04.410
Anyone who misses the last train
gets a trip to Heaven.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:07.040
Vulturius?

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:09.790
Its power has increased since
the New Guinea incident!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.000
It was powerful enough back then
to wipe out the entire island

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.620
if Tempestas hadn't protected everyone!

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:19.750
That's the point! They're trying to make
it look as if these guys never existed.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.040
"Please take action before this is all over."

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.410
Did you come to kill Mama?

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:32.370
Well, that's too bad.
You aren't getting past this point.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.080
Because...

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.410
...you're going to die here!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.700
Hiems, you...

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.000
There is an abnormal reaction
in the power room!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.450
All power is being directed to Schmelzofen!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:07.910
Where is Mr. Karasu?

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.250
Mischling...?

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:18.950
That's right. It's the union
of a human and an iDOL.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.790
If we do that, could I merge with Imber?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:26.160
Yes. If all goes well, you could hold
Imber himself inside of your body.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:30.870
No, you could become one with Imber!

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:33.040
Really? That's amazing!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.250
I can become one with Imber?

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:37.250
Nothing was born from that plan.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:41.370
No, we were probably already aware
that nothing could be born from it.

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:46.120
My child...?

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:50.750
That's right. I used your oocyte
to create the Riffa Series.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:56.910
Unlike you two, she will possess inborn
iDOL genes. She's the second generation.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:02.500
Epimetheus here utilizes the Riffa Series'
exact opposite framework.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:09.660
We create a man-made iDOL and then
merge a human with it to unify the two.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:14.660
The further we progressed, the further
we drew from that original point.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:17.580
I grew too afraid to pull back.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:25.830
Isn't this wonderful? If we could gather all
five iDOLs and successfully open Aulyn,

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:30.040
this time the path to creating
a Mischling is bound to open!

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:33.910
I knew, and yet...

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.250
I knew that this would happen...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:51.620
The bridge fell down!

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:52.290
We lost the bridge!
The bridge fell down!

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.580
She ticks me off!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:04.040
This is what you wanted, isn't it, Chihaya?

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.660
Mother...

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.290
Do you intend to continue on as you have?

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:15.370
iDOLs don't want to
become one with humans.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.370
Why don't you accept that already?

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.910
Accept that the Mischling Plan
was a failure.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:28.120
All you did was create a pitiable human
who is trapped by those ideals.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.830
Let's put an end to this... to everything.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.450
Please don't kill her off.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.830
I can still use her.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:11.120
My father was a former member
of the Cat's Grand Lodge.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:14.750
In order to punish them
for exiling my father,

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.370
I received a little of
assistance from your mother.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:24.120
She locked away her own mind
a long time ago, but I can still use her.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:28.410
It would be most problematic
if you killed her.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:31.450
This was over something so trivial...?

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:36.290
Trivial? But aren't you doing
the exact same thing?

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.080
Wh-what was that?!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:44.370
Hurry! Go to Mama!

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.370
What is this?!

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.040
The light of Schmelzofen...

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:57.080
The door is opening.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.330
I can feel her.

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:13.200
Chihaya... She is here.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:18.660
Tell me. Can't you sense her, Nubilum?

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.790
Mischling...

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:26.540
Now the world shall be saved.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:29.080
Aulyn will respond to this.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:32.830
Chihaya?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.910
Good night...

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.120
...Mama.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:49.000
I won again!

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:51.700
Are you losing on purpose by any chance?

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.750
Replay the message.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:04.200
Uh, hello, Yayoi.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:05.500
Emergency
Message Service
Playing the message
from Haruka Amami.
End

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:09.580
You see, I... I pilot an iDOL.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.200
What's that?!

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.580
You know what, Imber?
Hey, Ribbon!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.290
You know what, Imber?
What's going on, Ribbon?!

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.700
I like you. I love you.
What's going on, Ribbon?!

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.500
Hey! Do you copy, Ribbon?!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.660
That's why...

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:25.450
The gravitational disturbance is affecting
an area with over a 400,000km diameter!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.660
Detecting signs of the Minkowski limit!
The gravitational disturbance is affecting
an area with over a 400,000km diameter!

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:28.410
At this rate, it is going
to devour the entire planet!

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:29.660
That's...!
At this rate, it is going
to devour the entire planet!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.660
What on Earth is that?!

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:41.540
Hey, Nubilum, look.
Chihaya is pushing us along.

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:44.830
So...

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:46.450
So...

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.790
...let's go!

00:21:55.790 --> 00:22:04.700
Toki o wataru seija no you ni

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:13.700
Donna kodoku ni naite ita no?

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:22.580
Haruka tooi hoshi o tsunagi

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:31.120
Ne, omoi o egaku wa, sora o miagete

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:42.540
Dear boy, itsumo kokoro ni anata o sagaseba

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:51.540
Ah, dakishimeru hodo ni tsuyoi hikari o hanatsu no

00:22:51.540 --> 00:23:00.500
Mabataku kidou ga futari no mejirushi

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:12.080
Ima doko de mite ite mo truth kanjitete

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:40.450
Preview
Spring Snow

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:32.910
Light, snow, sky, a warm hand,
a cold hand,

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:36.540
a face that won't turn back
and eyes I can't see.

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:40.500
I am waiting, waiting for you.
